{"concept":"nausea","groups":[{"id":"source-use","name":{"ru":"Употребления в речи, образе и действии","en":"Uses in speech, image and action"},"count":36}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-6347ae67f8d6f32124ab9d0c9ccaf376","tos.text-unit.sid-6347ae67f8d6f32124ab9d0c9ccaf376"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"saint","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["affirmation","dance","saint"],"line":{"ru":"Святой узнаёт чистый взгляд и танцующий шаг Заратустры.","en":"The saint recognizes Zarathustra’s clear gaze and dancing step."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-8d9fcbeedef38695718bc5a8de65c6f2","tos.text-unit.sid-8d9fcbeedef38695718bc5a8de65c6f2"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"people","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Великий час делает привычные счастье, разум и добродетель предметами отвращения.","en":"The great hour makes familiar happiness, reason and virtue objects of disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e10d5a549111b35ec0a7ddc7074e872b","tos.text-unit.sid-e10d5a549111b35ec0a7ddc7074e872b"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"judges","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Заратустра испытывает отвращение к благонравию «добрых».","en":"Zarathustra feels disgust at the “good” people’s respectability."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-b191325a17b3bda7958113c253d776b2","tos.text-unit.sid-b191325a17b3bda7958113c253d776b2"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение угрожает самому желанию жить.","en":"Disgust threatens the desire to live itself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-de25f0531457653168ece86def58b60b","tos.text-unit.sid-de25f0531457653168ece86def58b60b"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["redemption","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Освобождение от отвращения становится вопросом о новом взгляде.","en":"Release from disgust becomes a question of a renewed gaze."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f608c1e41b9c21b36c18d056d92a0a10","tos.text-unit.sid-f608c1e41b9c21b36c18d056d92a0a10"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","creation","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение создаёт крылья для нового источника радости.","en":"Disgust creates wings toward a new spring of joy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-04de599f1e6f6217b3b18abe5de66e2a","tos.text-unit.sid-04de599f1e6f6217b3b18abe5de66e2a"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Враги превращают близких в повод отвращения.","en":"Enemies turn those nearest into a cause of disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e4551354f1a48f46e7362448a4be0389","tos.text-unit.sid-e4551354f1a48f46e7362448a4be0389"]},"form":"ekelte","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Испорченный путь лишает слепого прежней радости ходьбы.","en":"The spoiled path deprives the blind one of walking’s former joy."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f17106c0fd324c14f593c65394d4056f","tos.text-unit.sid-f17106c0fd324c14f593c65394d4056f"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Возвышенный ещё хранит презрение и отвращение.","en":"The sublime one still harbours contempt and disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-731a9e34e7c14198ab956f27436becc4","tos.text-unit.sid-731a9e34e7c14198ab956f27436becc4"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["bite","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение пастуха видимо в лице и впившейся змее.","en":"The shepherd’s disgust appears in his face and the fastened snake."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7a283fb2da9d76328d331e581c823e09","tos.text-unit.sid-7a283fb2da9d76328d331e581c823e09"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"sailors","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["bite","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение, ненависть и сострадание кричат одним голосом.","en":"Disgust, hatred and compassion cry with one voice."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-785a65a5a8cd860af767253880962323","tos.text-unit.sid-785a65a5a8cd860af767253880962323"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение удерживает учителя от нападения на покорных.","en":"Disgust restrains the teacher from attacking the submissive."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a90f42af507b4d19141536a4c9184453","tos.text-unit.sid-a90f42af507b4d19141536a4c9184453"]},"form":"ekelt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"fool","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["attention","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель прерывает речь шута отвращением к её способу.","en":"The teacher interrupts the fool’s speech through disgust at its manner."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-839ea728ca3ed687f09469f87114c21e","tos.text-unit.sid-839ea728ca3ed687f09469f87114c21e"]},"form":"ekelt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"fool","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение учителя охватывает и шута, и город.","en":"The teacher’s disgust embraces both fool and city."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.10","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-ffb2fd78ca22b7afab580adb8b12e12a","tos.text-unit.sid-ffb2fd78ca22b7afab580adb8b12e12a"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Здоровая самость отвергает бесконечное терпение ядовитых обид.","en":"Healthy selfhood rejects endlessly enduring poisonous wrongs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f3cd78e271d510f6aa90edc5dfa9b724","tos.text-unit.sid-f3cd78e271d510f6aa90edc5dfa9b724"]},"form":"ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Собственное внутреннее бывает скользким и трудным для понимания.","en":"One’s own interior can be slippery and hard to grasp."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bd88f45ec1d40fa6b178f82421512ad5","tos.text-unit.sid-bd88f45ec1d40fa6b178f82421512ad5"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","creation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение создаёт крылья и способность предчувствовать источники.","en":"Disgust creates wings and the power to sense springs."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f55e690a56221d3d97a1bc591db49918","tos.text-unit.sid-f55e690a56221d3d97a1bc591db49918"]},"form":"Ekeln","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Даже лучшее требует дальнейшего преодоления.","en":"Even the best calls for further overcoming."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.12","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-23f9103e168cc5b598aa582927a7197f","tos.text-unit.sid-23f9103e168cc5b598aa582927a7197f"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Разрыв с прежними добрыми открывает великое морское отвращение.","en":"Breaking with the former good opens a great seasick disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e5d4f2ac72b3af093c51baa21c803d44","tos.text-unit.sid-f95ccd37604cde247a392bebe2a9ea3e"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"abysmal-thought","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Приход глубокой мысли вызывает крик отвращения.","en":"The deep thought’s coming provokes a cry of disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-9f1471144e729291311298ed75a2a53b","tos.text-unit.sid-1fdb6b338b3ca379b3fc0d4b9a295d84"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"animals","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","memory","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Память болезни вновь отзывается криком отвращения.","en":"The illness’s memory answers again with disgust’s cry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f4e8fe1e2012ca93a1a7b23140951934","tos.text-unit.sid-f4e8fe1e2012ca93a1a7b23140951934"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"kings","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","identity","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Король испытывает отвращение к собственной переодетой власти.","en":"The king feels disgust at his own disguised power."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-739c651d2346f9c92f4052e46ecb7c03","tos.text-unit.sid-739c651d2346f9c92f4052e46ecb7c03"]},"form":"ekel","speaker":"kings","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Короли признают разрыв между первенством и его изображением.","en":"The kings acknowledge a gap between being first and representing it."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-293b0c71a4b3669f60c623a3d0c32847","tos.text-unit.sid-293b0c71a4b3669f60c623a3d0c32847"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"kings","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["kings"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение ставит под вопрос королевское первенство.","en":"Disgust questions royal precedence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.03","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-cf95b56cac3020c575b3d1a647f50984","tos.text-unit.sid-cf95b56cac3020c575b3d1a647f50984"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"kings","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["attention","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Король узнаёт в отвращении брата старую болезнь.","en":"The king recognizes his brother’s disgust as an old illness."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e1f2558da67b9bfc22c8e1a0804bfe8b","tos.text-unit.sid-e1f2558da67b9bfc22c8e1a0804bfe8b"]},"form":"ekelt","speaker":"conscientious","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","conscientious"],"line":{"ru":"Совестливый отвергает половинчатое знание своим отвращением.","en":"The conscientious one rejects half-knowledge through disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5d19b7cb05f16d36816aeade2c01a3a6","tos.text-unit.sid-5d19b7cb05f16d36816aeade2c01a3a6"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"magician","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение остаётся подлинным словом чародея.","en":"Disgust remains the magician’s genuine word."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-48d24cdee55df309a5ae6add3617b9fa","tos.text-unit.sid-48d24cdee55df309a5ae6add3617b9fa"]},"form":"ekelt","speaker":"magician","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["magician"],"line":{"ru":"Чародей признаёт усталость от собственного притворства.","en":"The magician admits weariness of his own pretence."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-e69b6bcafb85386b037fb90aeabe089b","tos.text-unit.sid-e69b6bcafb85386b037fb90aeabe089b"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"beggar","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["beggar"],"line":{"ru":"Нищий называет отвращение общей современной печалью.","en":"The beggar calls disgust a shared present sorrow."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-092f0903042823c906ea507637d1a2b4","tos.text-unit.sid-092f0903042823c906ea507637d1a2b4"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"beggar","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","beggar"],"line":{"ru":"Нищий приветствует учителя победителем великого отвращения.","en":"The beggar greets the teacher as conqueror of great disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.08","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-521b7374e233240be4333cd817205e42","tos.text-unit.sid-521b7374e233240be4333cd817205e42"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"beggar","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"question","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","beggar"],"line":{"ru":"Нищий называет отвращение к богатым причиной своего ухода.","en":"The beggar names disgust at the wealthy as his reason for leaving."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c7837ac2a39b527c1043a1ed611768c0","tos.text-unit.sid-08d70a2a30187d67d605691a82291aad"]},"form":"Ekels","speaker":"kings","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["will","identity","kings"],"line":{"ru":"Короли приводят людей отвращения к великой надежде.","en":"The kings bring people of disgust toward great hope."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.11","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-815a795f8880f224d0b9aa5a76de3fd6","tos.text-unit.sid-815a795f8880f224d0b9aa5a76de3fd6"]},"form":"Ekels","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Учитель объявляет ожидание иных будущих людей.","en":"The teacher declares his expectation of other future people."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-489b30ca70e35b7b486968ce031e5939","tos.text-unit.sid-489b30ca70e35b7b486968ce031e5939"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["fate","will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Претензия малых властвовать над судьбой вызывает отвращение.","en":"The small people’s claim to rule fate provokes disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bc92a642f0aa1f28bfeab5950e29a0b5","tos.text-unit.sid-bc92a642f0aa1f28bfeab5950e29a0b5"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"magician","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"song","group":"source-use","neighbours":["identity","death-of-god","magician"],"line":{"ru":"Смерть старого Бога оставляет слушателей в общем отвращении.","en":"The old God’s death leaves the listeners in shared disgust."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bf307ba8619bb6e94c7f1fe1bac40900","tos.text-unit.sid-bf307ba8619bb6e94c7f1fe1bac40900"]},"form":"Ekel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"source-use","neighbours":["becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Отвращение отступает, а гости обретают уверенность.","en":"Disgust retreats and the guests gain confidence."}}]}
